translatedData.subTitle:
After a heavy week for the crypto market, many memecoins faced strong corrections alongside Bitcoin and altcoins.
But even with a more defensive scenario, some continue to dominate:
volume;
engagement;
social media;
and speculative attention.
And this shows an important thing:
the market hasn't completely lost its risk appetite yet.
Today, the most watched memecoins continue to be:
DOGE $DOGE ;
SHIB $SHIB ;
PEPE $PEPE ;
BONK;
and WIF.
Each one represents a different behavior of the current market.
